                    <elementInformation name="description" show="1">Miniature circuit breaker iC60N, 4 poles, 10 A, C curve, thermal-magnetic, 10 kA (IEC/EN 60947-2). Width 8 x 9 mm (72 mm), height 85 mm. One terminal per pole, top and bottom (1-2, 3-4...).</elementInformation>
